 null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 323.1171875, 180.25, 334.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 349.9765625, 541.5, 377.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 393.9765625, 541.5, 421.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十四条 关于期限的问答\n\n问：拿到发票后是否重新计算30天？答：本制度写明费用发生后30个自然日，未写明收到发票后重新起算，不能自行改变口径。问：遇到周末可否自动顺延？答：本文未规定顺延，需要补充依据。\n\n问：另一份文件规定15天，应采用哪一个？答：本制度未说明与其他制度的优先关系，也未提供范围清单。应核对双方适用范围、有效性及批准文件；不能仅以日期较新、", "rrf_score": 0.031258, "bm25_score": 4.39572, "vector_score": 0.483144}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c013", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r013", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第十三条期限问答"], "token_count": 223, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 184.18751220703126, 146.36192626953124, 195.64617919921875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9986509010195732}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 210.9244140625, 541.454541015625, 256.75908203125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9981319904327393}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 272.0373046875, 536.801416015625, 302.1693603515625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9984620551805239}], "snippet": "第十三条期限问答\n\n问：十五天是工作日吗？答：本文写的是15个自然日，包含周末与节假日。问：财务需要在15天内付款吗？答：15天是申请提交期限，本文没有规定付款时限。问：补开发票后期限重新开始吗？答：本文没有这一规定，不能自动重新起算。\n\n问：超过15天是否绝对不能报？答：本文没有规定超期处置、豁免条件和批准权限，不能推导出绝对结论。问：本制度是否只适用于某", "rrf_score": 0.03101, "bm25_score": 5.573259, "vector_score": 0.452461}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c014", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r014", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第十四条冲突资料的核对清单"], "token_count": 225, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 322.1159423828125, 203.04544677734376, 334.4234130859375], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9989650157781748}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 348.85283203125, 546.953662109375, 379.4093017578125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9990319925911573}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 392.5655517578125, 541.454541015625, 423.54638671875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9992972043427554}], "snippet": "第十四条冲突资料的核对清单\n\n发现其他制度给出不同期限时，应记录其文档ID、版本日期、适用范围、具体条款和是否包含明确替代声明。范围缺失时，不能假定两份文件适用于不同部门而消解冲突；日期较新也不足以证明旧制度失效。\n\n可以向制度管理方请求有效制度清单、批准文件或具体适用说明。没有获得这些依据之前，应明确保留15天与30天的冲突，不应向申请人承诺任一规则必然适", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 6.076034, "vector_score": 0.391847}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c015", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r015", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第十五条流程状态与记录"], "token_count": 208, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.22329406738281, 443.49296875, 179.77982177734376, 455.800439453125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.999063334681771}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [47.3772705078125, 470.2298828125, 541.031494140625, 516.488916015625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9986456962341957}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.22329406738281, 531.3427734375, 541.031494140625, 560.626025390625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9994893606672896}], "snippet": "第十五条流程状态与记录\n\n提交成功、待补正、业务审核通过、财务审核通过和支付完成属于不同状态。状态变化应保留时间、处理角色和意见，方便后续解释为什么退回、修改了哪些字段以及是否已付款。口头反馈不能替代有对应单号的正式记录。\n\n申请人查询进度时，应提供申请单号及相关日期，不应发送账号密码、动态验证码或无关个人信息。本文未承诺固定响应时间，也未规定紧急付款的特殊", "rrf_score": 0.015625, "bm25_score": 0.457697, "vector_score": 0.460749}]}}
